Cached the profile pointer in a local and combined the null/range checks into one short-circuit condition, reducing repeated member loads on the hot path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    const Profile* p = profile;
    if ((p == NULL) || (profileIndex >= p->numFields))
        return 0;
    return p->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
}
```